config.error.yaml [error]: {file}: invalid {yaml}: {parser_message} {file}: path, path of the YAML file being read (homebot.yml, decisions.yml or a profile); {parser_message}: string, Bun's YAML parser error (English, tool text); {yaml}: string, the config format (fixed), YAML
